			"notes": "Added respawn invulnerability (configurable with gamerules). \nWhen invulnerable, players cannot attack you and you cannot attack other players. Other forms of damage are still valid.\nAn optional coutdown timer is present (configurable with gamerules) if you want to notify players when they are about to be vulnerable.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Tater-Certified/FairFight/compare/mc26.2-1.1.1...mc26.2-1.2.0"
